<title>FRANCE: Two ships loading wheat in Rouen, three more due.</title>
<headline>Two ships loading wheat in Rouen, three more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships were loading 26,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen for export to South Africa and Portugal, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Three more ships were expected in Rouen by July 3 to load 39,000 tonnes of wheat. The destination was not specified. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
